Not in the distribution
-----------------------

veraPDF (GPL-3.0-or-later / MPL-2.0) validates PDF/UA output in this project's
tests. It is a build-time test dependency only and is not shipped.

No restricted typeface or brand asset is shipped: no GDS Transport, no
Frutiger, no crown or NHS artwork. A publisher entitled to a brand font
supplies it at run time with --fonts.
